+ * Per MS-RDPBCGR 2.2.1.3.2 this field accepts ONLY 100, 140, or 180, and an
+ * out-of-enum value makes the server discard desktopScaleFactor as well - so
+ * this must always return one of the three. 180 additionally requires a tall
